{"ID":"20230928085411-urpwkvb","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230928085411-urpwkvb","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928085411-urpwkvb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928085429-55645rm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928085444-sik6lte\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928085429-55645rm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"合谷穴","type":"doc","updated":"20230928085444"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230928085429-55645rm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085429-55645rm","updated":"20230928085429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合谷穴，手阳明大肠经的原穴，虚症实症都可以治疗；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085429-sg07vsu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085429-sg07vsu","updated":"20230928085429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合谷穴往下拇指与食指骨头接近的一处交接点，有一奇穴称之为‘牙痛合谷穴’，因大肠经经过上门牙，所以该穴位可治疗上门牙的牙痛；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085430-n65cbig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085430-n65cbig"}},{"ID":"20230928085438-qcxgnqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085438-qcxgnqj","updated":"20230928085438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20230928085438-navy97s.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20230928085439-m0fa0ri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085439-m0fa0ri"}},{"ID":"20230928085444-slxziue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085444-slxziue","updated":"20230928085444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"手阳明大肠经经过上门牙的牙齿，所以牙齿痛是上牙痛时下合谷穴（遵守对称治疗原则，上牙左边痛时扎右边合谷，上牙右边痛时扎左边合谷，左右痛则两边都扎）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085444-pmhgeb0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085444-pmhgeb0","updated":"20230928085444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合谷穴是气脉，所以合谷穴越高的人，气越足；所以久病之人合谷瘦；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085444-ty9vix6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085444-ty9vix6","updated":"20230928085444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"面口合谷收：面相或口部的病，都可以在合谷下针；如面部中风；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085444-sik6lte","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085444-sik6lte","updated":"20230928085444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"常常下面针，即脸上下针或头上透针时，常常会下合谷穴，因为合谷有麻醉作用，扎针不那么痛；（对称治疗法，对侧合谷下针）"}]}]}